  m_text: "Hey Dad, I came by earlier but you were asleep and I didn't want to wake
    you. I stopped by the store and got some groceries, you should be able to make
    a great sandwich now! I also put your laundry into the washer, all you have to
    do is start it. I didn't have time to separate it, so make sure you set it to
    Mixed Load! While I was waiting in the checkout line I saw a fun new puzzle game
    I thought you'd like to try. I know that old Jigsaw was getting boring so hopefully
    this one can help you keep your mind sharp! I left it on your desk for you. \nLove
    you, see you soon."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
